/-
  LeanVM.Guest.B1.Tables.Vt.EvalsT

  The templates of `verify_tables`' table evaluations: the 153 words read, each copied,
  and the 38 permutations between them.
  `scripts/b1c-vt/all.py` writes the data `vtEvalData` and `vtPermData` (`regen-guest.sh`, step
  `vt`).
-/

module

public import LeanVM.Guest.B1.Tables.Vt.ZcRun
public import LeanVM.Guest.B1.Gkr.Layer

/-!
# The table evaluations' templates

`vtEvalData[k]`: evaluation `k`'s first statement and its value; it is `fs_next` at the cursor
`σ 2645` (offset `k`, the words `col_eval_words` names), copied into `col_evals`. `vtPermData[j]`: the permutation before evaluation `4(j + 1)`, its first statement
and its outputs' first value. Generated by `scripts/b1c-vt/genevals.py`.
-/

